{"id":"n84082-1-9","stage":1,"title":"한가하다 · 闲适","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84082-1-9-1","ko":"박 선생님은 요즘도 바쁘세요?","zh":"朴老师最近还忙吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"박","meaning":"朴（姓氏）","explanation":"박：朴（姓氏）。","readings":[{"term":"박","audio":"/audio/a2ed2af4650eb11ce3b7.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"박","audio":"/audio/a2ed2af4650eb11ce3b7.mp3"}},{"text":"선생님은","meaning":"老师，教师","explanation":"선생님：老师，教师；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"1","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님은","audio":"/audio/c7ef4222518a3b7c537d.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘도","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘도","audio":"/audio/7afb6aa8f58b38f4cfb8.mp3"}},{"text":"바쁘세요?","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바쁘세요","audio":"/audio/cfdca703c4f4eb8db43e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"老师，教师","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"(敬语)教授学生的人。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3fd2d0e251d58956486.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84082-1-9-2","k